  _headline: "Auditoria acha discrimina\xE7\xE3o nos algoritmos da prefeitura"
  _headlineEn: Audit finds discrimination in City Hall's algorithms
  _body: "Treinado com dados do passado, o sistema repetiu injusti\xE7as sem ningu\xE9m
    notar. A secretaria prometeu rever o que nunca tinha lido."
  _bodyEn: Trained on past data, the system repeated injustices unnoticed. The department
    vowed to review what it had never read.
